e":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T19:37:16-07:00","id":1118362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>roleplayrose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118361#post1118361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure, werewolves. But not Garou. If you think that's what Garou are, then you clearly don't pay attention.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're a bunch of murderous rage-filled predators who are at war with human society and struggle with said rage.<br /> <br /> Albeit, I think it may be overstated in what we've heard of the game.<br /> <br /> They're very much creatures of the night.<br /> <br /> War on Evil Spirits aside.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T19:48:17-07:00","id":1118366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118362#post1118362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They're a bunch of murderous rage-filled predators who are at war with human society and struggle with said rage.<br /> <br /> Albeit, I think it may be overstated in what we've heard of the game.<br /> <br /> They're very much creatures of the night.<br /> <br /> War on Evil Spirits aside.</div> </div> </div> </div>But the whole point of being a garou is to be a *righteous* rage-filled predator who is fighting to make everything better for the planet. You can't put the war on evil aside because it is LITERALLY the whole point of the game. The reason Garou is beautiful and special is because it has intrinsic meaning, they have built in Truth and Justice and Hope and Beauty. They fight a worthy cause because it is worthy. If they were just werewolves who mindlessly killed for the sake of mindless killing, it wouldn't be that great of a game. It wouldn't be worth playing in the same way that Garou is worth playing. Because yea, there's Rage and yeah, there's struggle, but there's also nobility, even when the world is dying around you. <br /> <br /> Being a Ronin lacks that natural motivation. If I wanted to be a whiney werewolf who moaned about how awesome it is to be a werewolf, or forgot that the planet literally gifted him everything and therefore deserves protection, I would go watch Twilight or some shit. And yeah, the Garou Nation is fucked up, but that's why it's so interesting to be a Gaian Garou.<br /> <br /> But either way... why make a game about a tiny fraction of not-really-player-characters? That's like making a vampire game that is about a Gargoyle. It misses the whole point of the rpg as a whole and discounts and undermines what the game is really about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T19:48:27-07:00","id":1118367,"title":"","content":"Here's how I imagine the story will go:<br /> <br /> * You start the game as a Ronin Garou who has either amnesia or has their backstory explained to them early on. &quot;You were a Garou who were part of a sept but have been cast out in recent years due to some crime you were accused of.&quot; I predict it will be perhaps something like Lee in The Walking Dead where your crime is something understanable like killing a superior ranked Garou outside of a challenge.<br /> <br /> * At the Sept in the region, you'll have a Silver Fang King who is complete scum and an arrogant asshole because they're easy Heels to throw at players. The Silver Fang King will be secretly corrupted by the Wyrm.<br /> <br /> * The other factions at the Sept will include the Shadow Lords who will be the EVIL Garou who want to overthrow the Silver Fang King as well as those who want to reform the King. Maybe also a third Gaian Garou faction of Bone Gnawers and Glass Walkers.<br /> <br /> * The area of the Garou is being intruded on by Pentex and their Black Spiral Dancer allies who the PC is about the only person who can do anything against because the actual Sept and its rulership is a mess right now.<br /> <br /> * You can ally with one of the factions to do their dirty work or do the dirty work of multiple ones before finally choosing. This will eventually make you choose who will be the new King after you finally challenge the Silver Fang King with one of the fangs backing you up. You will possibly be able to be the King yourself.<br /> <br /> * I see possible locations as a BSD Hive underground, a rural town, a Pentex Factory, the Spirit World, and the Sept itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T19:51:33-07:00","id":1118370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>roleplayrose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118366#post1118366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But the whole point of being a garou is to be a *righteous* rage-filled predator who is fighting to make everything better for the planet. You can't put the war on evil aside because it is LITERALLY the whole point of the game. The reason Garou is beautiful and special is because it has intrinsic meaning, they have built in Truth and Justice and Hope and Beauty. They fight a worthy cause because it is worthy. If they were just werewolves who mindlessly killed for the sake of mindless killing, it wouldn't be that great of a game. It wouldn't be worth playing in the same way that Garou is worth playing. Because yea, there's Rage and yeah, there's struggle, but there's also nobility, even when the world is dying around you.<br /> <br /> Being a Ronin lacks that natural motivation. If I wanted to be a whiney werewolf who moaned about how awesome it is to be a werewolf, or forgot that the planet literally gifted him everything and therefore deserves protection, I would go watch Twilight or some shit. And yeah, the Garou Nation is fucked up, but that's why it's so interesting to be a Gaian Garou.<br /> <br /> But either way... why make a game about a tiny fraction of not-really-player-characters? That's like making a vampire game that is about a Gargoyle. It misses the whole point of the rpg as a whole and discounts and undermines what the game is really about.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you miss the big part of Werewolf the Apocalypse if you start with the idea the Garou haven't failed their mission and failed it completely. The Apocalypse is on the rise and the Garou can't do anything about it because they were too selfish, evil, and racist to overcome their flaws.<br /> <br /> It's less about how you win the Apocalypse than how you die.<br /> <br /> Because you may be an honorable warrior of Gaia and protector of the week but the Garou next to you murdered a baby in a frenzy and ignores the Child Molestor spirit to figure out how he can get to Rank 3.<br /> <br /> It's a horror game about how heroism has failed in the face of violence and power hunger and quest for prestige. Garou Westeros.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T19:51:46-07:00","id":1118371,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>roleplayrose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118361#post1118361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure, werewolves. But not Garou. If you think that's what Garou are, then you clearly don't pay attention.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're going to need to outline this &quot;Garou are not werewolves&quot; thinking. Because they are werewolves. A specific take on werewolves, but werewolves nevertheless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T19:56:11-07:00","id":1118374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118371#post1118371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You're going to need to outline this &quot;Garou are not werewolves&quot; thinking. Because they are werewolves. A specific take on werewolves, but werewolves nevertheless.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, they are werewolves, but they are so much more interesting than generic werewolves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T20:00:09-07:00","id":1118375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118370#post1118370\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think you miss the big part of Werewolf the Apocalypse if you start with the idea the Garou haven't failed their mission and failed it completely. The Apocalypse is on the rise and the Garou can't do anything about it because they were too selfish, evil, and racist to overcome their flaws.<br /> <br /> It's less about how you win the Apocalypse than how you die.<br /> <br /> Because you may be an honorable warrior of Gaia and protector of the week but the Garou next to you murdered a baby in a frenzy and ignores the Child Molestor spirit to figure out how he can get to Rank 3.<br /> <br /> It's a horror game about how heroism has failed in the face of violence and power hunger and quest for prestige. Garou Westeros.</div> </div> </div> </div>They haven't &quot;failed&quot; if there is even one standing to fight the fight. The point isn't winning, as you say, it's fighting. The point isn't that they aren't corrupt, it's that the heroic individual can choose to be better than that. And I agree, they will never 'win' nor will they ever completely stave off the Apocalypse, but that's not the point. Fighting the good fight and not giving up is the point. It's a game of *personal* horror, because you can swing wildly from being Rage filled monster to being Heroic warrior. Both sides can exist within you, but to ignore that is to miss a huge chunk of what makes the game special. *shrug* Play your game how you like it, but I choose to play as a hopeful character, and I always let my players make a personal difference in their world, even if it's not a global difference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T20:02:30-07:00","id":1118378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>roleplayrose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118375#post1118375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They haven't &quot;failed&quot; if there is even one standing to fight the fight. <b>The point isn't winning, as you say, it's fighting. </b>The point isn't that they aren't corrupt, it's that the heroic individual can choose to be better than that. And I agree, they will never 'win' nor will they ever completely stave off the Apocalypse, but that's not the point. Fighting the good fight and not giving up is the point. It's a game of *personal* horror, because you can swing wildly from being Rage filled monster to being Heroic warrior. Both sides can exist within you, but to ignore that is to miss a huge chunk of what makes the game special. *shrug* Play your game how you like it, but I choose to play as a hopeful character, and I always let my players make a personal difference in their world, even if it's not a global difference.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, that's not the point. That's what they've been reduced to by purging the Bunyip and the War of Rage and other things. You can fight but you should have been able to win.<br /> <br /> But that's just how I play it.<br /> <br /> Your table game may be different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T20:04:27-07:00","id":1118380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118378#post1118378\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, that's not the point. That's what they've been reduced to by purging the Bunyip and the War of Rage and other things. You can fight but you should have been able to win.<br /> <br /> But that's just how I play it.<br /> <br /> Your table game may be different.</div> </div> </div> </div>But it's not like you can go back and change any of that, you just have to roll with it. So why lament it? Just learn, move on, and be the best damn Garou you can. That's a lovely game, imho.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T20:06:16-07:00","id":1118381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>roleplayrose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118380#post1118380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But it's not like you can go back and change any of that, you just have to roll with it. So why lament it? Just learn, move on, and be the best damn Garou you can. That's a lovely game, imho.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, I think we're at the point of it being a tragedy when there's no salvation for the world because your ancestors and the people you are fighting in honor of, fucked up the world so much that it can't be saved.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T20:10:57-07:00","id":1118385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118381#post1118381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh, I think we're at the point of it being a tragedy when there's no salvation for the world because your ancestors and the people you are fighting in honor of, fucked up the world so much that it can't be saved.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Totally! It is a tragedy, and that's lovely. Life is a fucking tragedy, man. That's why the good parts are so good and to be savored. That's what motivates people to do good. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Raleway\">Only in darkness are we revealed. [...] Goodness is not goodness that seeks advantage. Good is good in the final hour, in the deepest pit, without hope, without witness, without reward. Virtue is only virtue in extremis.&quot;</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T20:30:10-07:00","id":1118392,"title":"","content":"I'll be okay with how the game comes out as long as it admits that the Garou Nation are not morally absolute and/or superior heroes, that it is riddled with flaws in both the past and the present, that they're responsible for Gaia's forces being crippled in the war against the Wyrm, and the end they're fighting for in no way justifies the means they're using. It seems that the Apocalypse's setting acknowledges this to an extent, but some people just... don't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T21:08:32-07:00","id":1118398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118392#post1118392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll be okay with how the game comes out as long as it admits that the Garou Nation are not morally absolute and/or superior heroes, that it is riddled with flaws in both the past and the present, that they're responsible for Gaia's forces being crippled in the war against the Wyrm, and the end they're fighting for in no way justifies the means they're using. It seems that the Apocalypse's setting acknowledges this to an extent, but some people just... don't.</div> </div> </div> </div>The opening comic of W20 is not nearly so hopeless. Quite the contrary, in fact. How Garou take the message of hope is up in the air, but it's still possible to take another look at your shit list and realize that you might be doing things out of order. It's not like the game is magically going to be solved even if you do manage that; the Garou and Fera already know what they should be doing, after all. The ranks of the opposition are still stocked up and imposing even if you're fighting the right fights and making amends with allies that you once drove away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 07-20-2017, 12:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-19T22:01:47-07:00","id":1118402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>roleplayrose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118374#post1118374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, they are werewolves, but they are so much more interesting than generic werewolves.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, thanks for clarifying. I agree! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T01:17:11-07:00","id":1118437,"title":"","content":"Well, I have two ronin characters that are not tribed due to personal reasons. One due to being a former BSD and so kinda afraid to get into the larger game again. Another because his catholic education, wendigo pb5 and white ways would basically doom him to death in the hands of his tribe as he is a lost cub.<br /> <br /> But in general, a lost cub could work in terms of introducing the player to the setting. A ronin is too aware of things to really serve as a conduit, especially how complex garou society is.<br /> <br /> This is, of course, assuming there is no Bitten.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T05:57:16-07:00","id":1118492,"title":"","content":"How can you have a former BSD? Once you walk the spiral, there is no coming back, you are forever bound to the Wyrm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T06:04:13-07:00","id":1118495,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118492#post1118492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How can you have a former BSD? Once you walk the spiral, there is no coming back, you are forever bound to the Wyrm.</div> </div> </div> </div>This was before 20th ed was released, back then, erebus could cleanse you from the taint and ties to the Wyrm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T07:44:56-07:00","id":1118551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118492#post1118492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How can you have a former BSD? Once you walk the spiral, there is no coming back, you are forever bound to the Wyrm.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well you can complete the 10th Level of the Black Spiral and emerge completely sane and purified.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T13:11:00-07:00","id":1118677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118495#post1118495\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This was before 20th ed was released, back then, erebus could cleanse you from the taint and ties to the Wyrm.</div> </div> </div> </div>IIRC W20 has maintained the same stance that previous editions have: Erebus can theoretically cleanse a BSD, but it's never successfully been accomplished. In W20's Umbra book has there currently a BSD in Erebus and the spirits there having spent a long time trying to make it happen.<br /> <br /> I mean, it actually happening isn't going to break the setting, but it's a pretty major event that would get a lot of attention. It seems perfectly reasonable that a BSD that managed it would be exceedingly nervous about being around the Garou Nation since there would be a lot of aggressive recruitment from former enemies, and probably a few Garou that don't want the question of redeemable BSDs hanging around wanting to disappear one that did it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T14:45:14-07:00","id":1118708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118677#post1118677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> IIRC W20 has maintained the same stance that previous editions have: Erebus can theoretically cleanse a BSD, but it's never successfully been accomplished. In W20's Umbra book has there currently a BSD in Erebus and the spirits there having spent a long time trying to make it happen.<br /> <br /> I mean, it actually happening isn't going to break the setting, but it's a pretty major event that would get a lot of attention. It seems perfectly reasonable that a BSD that managed it would be exceedingly nervous about being around the Garou Nation since there would be a lot of aggressive recruitment from former enemies, and probably a few Garou that don't want the question of redeemable BSDs hanging around wanting to disappear one that did it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was more blatantly clear in the Umbra revised that it could in fact cleanse a BSD and that it had happened before.<br /> <br /> Here is what the book says on BSDs that went through erebus;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong> Umbra revised p.66</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Black Spiral Dancers who survive Erebus and are cleansed may join whatever tribe will have them, beginning their new lives as cliath of the appropriate tribe. All their Gifts and rites are burned from them, forcing them to begin anew, but they become full members of their new tribe in every way upon their Rites of Passage.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-20T14:54:28-07:00","id":1118712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://f