 Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T01:05:28-07:00","id":1118863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118815#post1118815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You do start as a ronin, but I do think you get the option to join a tribe</div> </div> </div> </div>...a progression typically described as being a cub or Lost Cub rather than Ronin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T02:41:19-07:00","id":1118876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118863#post1118863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...a progression typically described as being a cub or Lost Cub rather than Ronin.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, if you are unaware of the garou society, you are a lost cub. Ronin is a 'choice'.<br /> <br /> For example, my wendigo lost cub only became ronin when he willingly chose to not assosiocate with the Nation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T02:57:01-07:00","id":1118879,"title":"","content":"The idea of being a Ronin by choice is, again, really weird as the Garou casting you out is pretty much how it's always been done in fiction. Can anyone name an NPC Ronin who was a Ronin by choice? The First Metis was cast out, Fights with Honor was a Ronin until he proved himself, Albretch was cast out of a Sept until he was given a place among them, and the other Garou did shunning until they made restittuion.<br /> <br /> Being a Ronin is a position until you've earned your way back, typically by a service so dire you die in the process.<br /> <br /> Also, Lost Cubs are typically adolescents not adults.<br /> <br /> <b>BUT </b>to add more to the discussion, the developrs haven't 100% said youre going to be a Ronin, have they? I may have misread it. They just said you aren't joining any factions for anything other than gifts. This debate could be over nothing and you're a typical Gaian garou who isn't part of the local power structures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-21-2017, 05:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T05:42:35-07:00","id":1118924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118876#post1118876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yep, if you are unaware of the garou society, you are a lost cub. Ronin is a 'choice'.<br /> <br /> For example, my wendigo lost cub only became ronin when he willingly chose to not assosiocate with the Nation.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bIt could always be that part of the story is proving yourself innocent of whatever made you a Ronin and then you get to join a tribe of your choice","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T06:22:07-07:00","id":1118933,"title":"","content":"It should end with you saving the entire world and preventing the Apocalypse with all of the Garou in the sept wanting you to be their leader then you walk past them and flip them off.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><i><b><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;THAT IS NOW HOW WEREWOLF: THE APOCALYPSE WORKS.&quot;</span></b></i></span><br /> <br /> Fine, fine!<br /> <br /> I'll just be over here.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T07:39:36-07:00","id":1118951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118879#post1118879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The idea of being a Ronin by choice is, again, really weird as the Garou casting you out is pretty much how it's always been done in fiction. Can anyone name an NPC Ronin who was a Ronin by choice? The First Metis was cast out,</div> </div> </div> </div>The First Ronin, you mean. That's the character's name or title, in any case the designation for it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Fights with Honor was a Ronin until he proved himself, Albretch was cast out of a Sept until he was given a place among them, and the other Garou did shunning until they made restittuion. </div> </div> </div>Albrecht was still a Rank 4 Silver Fang during the Combat Flip Book of Doom incident, per has writeup in Rage: Warriors of the Apocalypse. As Falcon said in Legacy Rite, Jonas's Grandfather didn't have the authority to do anything more than kick Albrecht out of the sept and insult him without renumeration (a moot* point, since Jacob Morningkill died not too long afterward).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Being a Ronin is a position until you've earned your way back, typically by a service so dire you die in the process.<br /> <br /> Also, Lost Cubs are typically adolescents not adults. </div> </div> </div>Except for Lunatics, which are still more widespread than Ronin.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>BUT </b>to add more to the discussion, the developrs haven't 100% said youre going to be a Ronin, have they? I may have misread it. They just said you aren't joining any factions for anything other than gifts. This debate could be over nothing and you're a typical Gaian garou who isn't part of the local power structures. </div> </div> </div>So, perhaps you're just a Garou who hasn't joined any Camps yet, the main purveyors of special Gifts in Garou society.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">*Ha ha ha ha! Get it?</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T07:43:27-07:00","id":1118955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118951#post1118951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, perhaps you're just a Garou who hasn't joined any Camps yet, the main purveyors of special Gifts in Garou society.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, so it may be a lot of discussion over nothing. After all, you still have a Clan in V:TM:B.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T21:45:34-07:00","id":1119766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118924#post1118924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bIt could always be that part of the story is proving yourself innocent of whatever made you a Ronin and then you get to join a tribe of your choice</div> </div> </div> </div>A quest to prove your innocence against a wrong conviction could make a good plot hook, but whatever the story turns out to be, it seems sensible to me for a single-player game with a linear plot to cast the player as a Ronin. It won't be the fully open-world we experience with a live storyteller and players with dice around a tabletop, but we really shouldn't expect that of a video game. As someone remarked above, any good werewolf-themed computer game should be welcome to a hungry fan base, and the world of darkness Garou are the best werewolves out there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T22:01:15-07:00","id":1119771,"title":"","content":"We already have that in the Wolf Among Us by Telltale Games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-23T22:07:59-07:00","id":1119772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wilson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1119766#post1119766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A quest to prove your innocence against a wrong conviction could make a good plot hook, but whatever the story turns out to be, it seems sensible to me for a single-player game with a linear plot to cast the player as a Ronin. It won't be the fully open-world we experience with a live storyteller and players with dice around a tabletop, but we really shouldn't expect that of a video game. As someone remarked above, any good werewolf-themed computer game should be welcome to a hungry fan base, and the world of darkness Garou are the best werewolves out there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>If it is a Ronin, I'm fairly sure it's going to be the Bloodlines take. Which I know is a broken record, &quot;This is going to be exactly like Bloodlines except werewolves.&quot; However, it's a very easy way to introduce new players into the WoD. &quot;You're an outsider to the system, you can work with various factions, and you are a solitary figure no one really likes until you win their respect.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T08:04:31-07:00","id":1119873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wilson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1119766#post1119766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(...) It won't be the <b><i>fully open-world we experience </i></b>with a live storyteller and players with dice around a tabletop, but we really shouldn't expect that of a video game. (...)</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-size:10px\">(emphasis in the quote mine) </span><br /> <br /> I think in a way we should <i>always </i>expect (and perhaps even demand) this in a RPG video game!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3254,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","user":"Muad'Dib","date":". 07-24-2017, 11:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T17:08:46-07:00","id":1120148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1119873#post1119873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">(emphasis in the quote mine) </span><br /> <br /> I think in a way we should <i>always </i>expect (and perhaps even demand) this in a RPG video game!</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I don't feel any particular loss not playing an Elder.<br /> <br /> You have to have some limits to tell a story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T05:22:24-07:00","id":1125184,"title":"","content":"a) Being a Ronin can be extremely dramatic for a story and give to the game a unique a mood, this game may introduce to us all a great new character. Apart from that, being ronin is not only about rejecting gaia, a character may become ronin by other ways, like killing a packmate while making a quest, taking drugs repeatedly, a prophecy of a grim looking theurge, or even being wrongly accused, being disapointed by failing an important personal goal or keep away from a forbidden garou love.<br /> All the above can make a garou go ronin or being forced to do so.<br /> <br /> b)Later on the story I think is a werewolf core theme to enter a tribe and a pack. Probably you may have pack assistance in the game later on, depening on what tribe you may choose, or ally with. Maybe there will be differend endings depending on what choices you make, garou, remaining a ronin or even wyrm. The scenario may be linear but thats not a bad thing, especially if the various choices you make change dramaticaly the way you reach the ending and not just the ending itself. I heard there will be influence between areas and the choices you make to the one may affect the other.<br /> <br /> c)Pentex being the primary antagonist doesn't mean it will only contain humans, it may have lordly fomories, black spiral leaders, first teams, sabbat vampires of nephandi mages, not to mention the various manufactured horrors, I don't think that you will win boss fights only by shifting crinos. Plus a malphean nightmare may run the current company, or an ancient beast waiting to get out of its slumber for a grand bam finale.<br /> <br /> d) Taking Rage as the core theme of the game, is an awesome choice. The idea that you will need high social skills in order to gain more dialogue options and avoid frenzy amazes me. Or even the possibility that frenzy is the right option to solve a problem. Rage is the heart of werewolf the apocalypse because it is a power and a weakness at the same time, it is righteous fury and unbound monstrosity, not to mention the possibility to lose and start over a quest because you frenzied and killed an npc or took multiple headshots because you didn't notice the five snipers on the upper floor, or that you got pissed off with another garou who talked bad about your grandpa. Its wonderful !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","user":"Story Letter","date":". 08-05-2017, 03:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T05:47:22-07:00","id":1125185,"title":"","content":"I still think it is making a mockery of the idea of being a Ronin. I think that it would be much better if they just did packs, like the teams of the recent Shadow run video game. The PC could be the only survivor of their previous pack, perhaps betrayed by a member who decided to join the BSD, and is forced to recruit other survivors into a new pack to hunt down the treasonous former packmate. The former packmate could have been given a contract with Pentex, requiring your pack to infiltrate Pentex to gain the info to his location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T06:14:51-07:00","id":1125191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125185#post1125185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still think it is making a mockery of the idea of being a Ronin. I think that it would be much better if they just did packs, like the teams of the recent Shadow run video game. The PC could be the only survivor of their previous pack, perhaps betrayed by a member who decided to join the BSD, and is forced to recruit other survivors into a new pack to hunt down the treasonous former packmate. The former packmate could have been given a contract with Pentex, requiring your pack to infiltrate Pentex to gain the info to his location.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or, as has been suggested in the past, like in XCOM.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T06:18:12-07:00","id":1125193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125185#post1125185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still think it is making a mockery of the idea of being a Ronin. I think that it would be much better if they just did packs, like the teams of the recent Shadow run video game. The PC could be the only survivor of their previous pack, perhaps betrayed by a member who decided to join the BSD, and is forced to recruit other survivors into a new pack to hunt down the treasonous former packmate. The former packmate could have been given a contract with Pentex, requiring your pack to infiltrate Pentex to gain the info to his location.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That would take personal drama away from the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","user":"Story Letter","date":". 08-05-2017, 09:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T08:27:11-07:00","id":1125234,"title":"","content":"Packs might work in something like Dragon Age: Origins but Bioware isn't making this. Cynanide is great but I suspect aspiring to V:TM: Bloodline is the limit of their technical aspirations.<br /> <br /> Also, make a mockery of Ronin?<br /> <br /> What?<br /> <br /> (Again, takes the view of Outcasts that Ronin are on the periphery of Garou society not out of it)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T13:40:13-07:00","id":1125332,"title":"","content":"In W20, Ronin are really outcasts who are the scavengers of the Garou. Without Rank or Renown, they have no place in Garou Society and are truly the scum of the Earth. In many ways, normal humans have more value than Ronin because normal humans did not purposefully betray their duties to Gaia. <br /> <br /> And we are not talking about anything technologically complex here, multiparty games have existed for decades. It would be no more complex than KotOR or KotOR 2, which are pretty old games now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","user":"Aya Tari","date":". 08-05-2017, 04:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T16:43:33-07:00","id":1125411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125332#post1125332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In W20, Ronin are really outcasts who are the scavengers of the Garou. <b>Without Rank or Renown, they have no place in Garou Society and are truly the scum of the Earth. In many ways, normal humans have more value than Ronin because normal humans did not purposefully betray their duties to Gaia.</b><br /> <br /> And we are not talking about anything technologically complex here, multiparty games have existed for decades. It would be no more complex than KotOR or KotOR 2, which are pretty old games now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thankfully, we're moving into 5th Edition and that hopefully will have a more nuanced look at Ronin.<br /> <br /> Plus, Aya, could you can the in-universe talk? I really get enough of that from the Star Wars forums and the faux Imperials. Ronin have no renown because they've been kicked out of the Garou nation for either crimes or being accused of crimes. None of which means they're traitors unless you think maybe wanting to marry your Garou spouse or reveal to your human wife that you're a werewolf are treason against Gaia.<br /> <br /> As for &quot;Pack&quot;, why would you start with one? You should forge those kind of relationships in game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 08-05-2017, 07:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T18:09:19-07:00","id":1125429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125411#post1125411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thankfully, we're moving into 5th Edition and that hopefully will have a more nuanced look at Ronin.</div> </div> </div> </div>I doubt that. ParaWolf seems pretty intent on using very early stuff, and Ronin have been exiles from Garou society, as in outside of it, since first edition.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Ronin have no renown because they've been kicked out of the Garou nation for either crimes or being accused of crimes. None of which means they're traitors unless you think maybe wanting to marry your Garou spouse or reveal to your human wife that you're a werewolf are treason against Gaia. </div> </div> </div>The former can stick in the craws of spirit allies, so it's not going to be allowed. The latter is far less likely to get you in quite as much trouble as the former, depending on how you handle it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for &quot;Pack&quot;, why would you start with one? You should forge those kind of relationships in game. </div> </div> </div>In the portion traditionally known as the &quot;tutorial&quot;. Seriously, it'd be way more managable to have a starting pack in their rite of passage being the beginning of the game, not a Ronin. Going for Ronin and blunting the severity of being Ronin comes across as trying to slavishly copy the story of Bloodlines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T18:16:58-07:00","id":1125433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125429#post1125429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I doubt that. ParaWolf seems pretty intent on using very early stuff, and Ronin have been exiles from Garou society, as in outside of it, since first edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except, again for Outcasts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The former can stick in the craws of spirit allies, so it's not going to be allowed. The latter is far less likely to get you in quite as much trouble as the former, depending on how you handle it. </div> </div> </div>Except for, again, in Outcasts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> In the portion traditionally known as the &quot;tutorial&quot;. Seriously, it'd be way more managable to have a starting pack in their rite of passage being the beginning of the game, not a Ronin. Going for Ronin and blunting the severity of being Ronin comes across as trying to slavishly copy the story of Bloodlines. </div> </div> </div>Bloodlines is awesome so why not?<br /> <br /> Also, I think Albretch is a great model for a character.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T18:24:50-07:00","id":1125437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125433#post1125433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Except, again for Outcasts.<br /> <br /> <br /> Except for, again, in Outcasts.</div> </div> </div> </div>And you're counting on them to keep that in for certain on what basis? If they're going back to 1e, they won't care about it. They might even leave it out on purpose. Their vision for the future is odd, because the only thing that we have to go on is what was OKed for MEt, and... ugh. No, BNS, Garou are not Wyld-aligned by default...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Bloodlines is awesome so why not? </div> </div> </div>It's a Vampire game. Its stuff doesn't work for Werewolf, which is a fundamentally different game from start to finish.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also, I think Albretch is a great model for a character. </div> </div> </div>We've been over this; he wasn't Ronin, he was Athro and still part of the Garou Nation, even if his grandfather wouldn't let him back into court with the Fangs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T19:23:25-07:00","id":1125457,"title":"","content":"How about this:<br /> <br /> If I'm being sold a video game of WtA, I expect to play something recognizable as what's in the WtA core books.<br /> <br /> If I'm being sold a video game of WOD: Outcasts, then I expect things to be twisted to be more fun for playing Ronin than how they're presented in every other WtA book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T20:50:40-07:00","id":1125474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125457#post1125457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about this:<br /> <br /> If I'm being sold a video game of WtA, I expect to play something recognizable as what's in the WtA core books.<br /> <br /> If I'm being sold a video game of WOD: Outcasts, then I expect things to be twisted to be more fun for playing Ronin than how they're presented in every other WtA book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it's confirmed it is Ronin.<br /> <br /> <i>Now that we know where <a href=\"http://www.cyanide-studio.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Cyanide Studio</a> is starting from, we can move right along into what else is known for <b>Werewolf: The Apocalypse</b>. Given that they are still in very early development, there is still no final script as of this interview, things will be a bit sparse here. I was able to get out of Julien, that while there will be tribes in the game, we will be taking on the role of Ronin and not directly linked to any one of them. The story will be a linear one with the illusion of choice, but the story will still go in the same direction no matter what is said and done. So don't look to be able to join any of the various ones out there to change things up besides the gifts you'll have at your disposal in the game.</i><br /> <br /> I admit, though, I consider playing outcasts of the Garou Nation to be something which is really a large part of the game's appeal. Metis, Bonegnawers, Albretch's history, and the very fact it is a prestige society means that I think Ronin is a great way to do an outsider's perspective.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T23:09:24-07:00","id":1125493,"title":"","content":"But WtA is very much not a game of Outcasts. It is a game about groups of furry superhuman kicking ass.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T00:19:24-07:00","id":1125506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125474#post1125474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, it's confirmed it is Ronin.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I know, which I have already voiced my dissatisfaction about in this thread.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I admit, though, I consider playing outcasts of the Garou Nation to be something which is really a large part of the game's appeal. Metis, Bonegnawers, Albretch's history, and the very fact it is a prestige society means that I think Ronin is a great way to do an outsider's perspective. </div> </div> </div>Except Metis, Gnawers, and Albretch <b>aren't outcasts</b>. They all represent characters that are disadvantaged for various reasons in Garou society, but they're all concepts that <u>are part of Garou society</u>; not outsiders to it.<br /> <br /> The appeal of that part the game is playing characters that are at the bottom rungs of society, and being able to make a difference - maybe even gain respect and status - despite that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T04:16:21-07:00","id":1125532,"title":"","content":"Outcasts is a very very early book, things have changed since then and the writers have changed their opinions on ronin. In the 1st ed, yes ronin could be mercs, that is why Outcasts made sense then. But these days, being ronin isn't anymore just being an outsider. It is rejecting the nation or being rejected by the nation, often for very grave reasons.<br /> <br /> This is very close to seeing an earlier version of one of my characters/writing, and going by that versions instead of the more current version.<br /> <br /> EDIT: A concrete example. <a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/art/Character-profile-Cuchulainn-72879966\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> is Cuchulainn when I first created him and played him. <a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/art/VdM-Charles-App-693579584\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> is him now. Just because the older version is there, doesn't mean it is valid anymore. Sure, you can use outcast in your own games, but it is simply outdated in terms of content.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":110,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","user":"Ana Mizuki","date":". 08-06-2017, 07:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T04:28:45-07:00","id":1125536,"title":"","content":"Albretch being an outcast is something which was talked about at length in THE SILVER CROWN. It talked about how before he got accepted into the New York City sept. I think this is going to be something which is going to be used as the model since Albretch is the iconic character from which you're probably going to imitate the role of. If you're an exile from the Garou, working from the sidelines, and eventually joining the society again nicely reflects that kind of story. You might only be exiled from the local caern.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125532#post1125532\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Outcasts is a very very early book, things have changed since then and the writers have changed their opinions on ronin. In the 1st ed, yes ronin could be mercs, that is why Outcasts made sense then. But these days, being ronin isn't anymore just being an outsider. It is rejecting the nation or being rejected by the nation, often for very grave reasons.<br /> <br /> This is very close to seeing an earlier version of one of my characters/writing, and going by that versions instead of the more current version.</div> </div> </div> </div>I suspect then I'm on the side of those who hopes this serves as a course correction for the line. Which will hopefully affect Ronin's portrayal in 5th edition and move them away from the terrible handling they had in 5th Edition.<br /> <br /> But yes, I understand the current treatment of Ronin is not similar to Outcasts but I think that doesn't mean it can't change back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T05:00:17-07:00","id":1125542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125536#post1125536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Albretch being an outcast is something which was talked about at length in THE SILVER CROWN. It talked about how before he got accepted into the New York City sept. I think this is going to be something which is going to be used as the model since Albretch is the iconic character from which you're probably going to imitate the role of. If you're an exile from the Garou, working from the sidelines, and eventually joining the society again nicely reflects that kind of story. You might only be exiled from the local caern.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it has been said before, but here goes. Albretch was exiled from his home sept. He was not exiled from the Nation at large. He still had access to totems, gifts, other septs, members of other tribes, his pack,etc. A ronin has none of those, not even among the Gnawers. Because to be a ronin, you have to have either rejected the Nation wholesale. Or done something -very- wrong. Otherwise, why would this garou stay ronin, if they had Children of Gaia or Bone Gnawers who'd take them in?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125536#post1125536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I suspect then I'm on the side of those who hopes this serves as a course correction for the line. Which will hopefully affect Ronin's portrayal in 5th edition and move them away from the terrible handling they had in 5th Edition.<br /> <br /> But yes, I understand the current treatment of Ronin is not similar to Outcasts but I think that doesn't mean it can't change back.</div> </div> </div> </div>In this, I have to say it might get worse. Given how the MET book was aided by one of the writers of the TT, and the Video Game's blurb about factions in plular, I fear it might go to that direction. This includes male Black Furies, the Ajaba now written as gender equal, Nation being split,etc. In addition of the skeevy stuff that might crop up like it has in Vampire.<br /> <br /> I mean, I play two ronins. I am well aware that they can be good characters. But even then, these characters are not those whom I'd use to showcase the setting. They are outliers by far.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T05:23:06-07:00","id":1125550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125542#post1125542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it has been said before, but here goes. Albretch was exiled from his home sept. He was not exiled from the Nation at large. He still had access to totems, gifts, other septs, members of other tribes, his pack,etc. A ronin has none of those, not even among the Gnawers. Because to be a ronin, you have to have either rejected the Nation wholesale. Or done something -very- wrong. Otherwise, why would this garou stay ronin, if they had Children of Gaia or Bone Gnawers who'd take them in?</div> </div> </div> </div>The problem with this is Ronin CAN be accepted back into the Garou Nation. They don't stay Ronin forever if they can make atonement for their crimes or get a tribe to take them back. Also, you missed the part about Albretch not being a Ronin but a good model for one getting accepted back into Garou society, right?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> In this, I have to say it might get worse. Given how the MET book was aided by one of the writers of the TT, and the Video Game's blurb about factions in plular, I fear it might go to that direction. This includes male Black Furies, the Ajaba now written as gender equal, Nation being split,etc. In addition of the skeevy stuff that might crop up like it has in Vampire.<br /> <br /> I mean, I play two ronins. I am well aware that they can be good characters. But even then, these characters are not those whom I'd use to showcase the setting. They are outliers by far. </div> </div> </div>1. Male Black Furies already exist, they're just all Metis.<br /> <br /> 2. Yeah, the matriarchy is a shame as that's real jackals.<br /> <br /> 3. I can't complain as I actually used that plot in my homegames with a Pure vs. Forsaken Civil War.<br /> <br /> 4. Werewolf got there first, admittedly, with the Seventh Generation.<br /> <br /> But I get your point.<br /> <br /> <b>Why do I think a Ronin is a good character type?</b><br /> <br /> I think it's a really good opportunity to show the importance of Garou society as well as its failures from an outsiders perspective. If you begin the game as a Ronin, you're sort of like the character in <i>The Elder Scrolls</i>. You have no resources, no caern, no fetishes, talents, gifts or anything else. It's a great excuse for playing an adult character versus a Lost Cub who will typically be teenagers. You have nothing and the spirits don't even like you either.<br /> <br /> So, as a Ronin, you'll have to start at the bottom and earn everyone's respect in the local sept and its factions. A lot of RPGs start with you as someone who is considered scum or an outsider which the Ronin is. By doing this, you can save the lives of other werewolves and gradually improve their opinion of you. It provides a natural &quot;end point&quot; in the game too which I think people are ignoring.<br /> <br /> Once you save the area from The Black Lodge, Pentex, The Eater of Souls (hopefully they won't go there), or The Black Spiral Dancer caern or all of the above then you can be welcomed into the Garou Nation once more.<br /> <br /> That's a pretty sweet happy ending and one entirely appropriate for W:TA.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T05:50:56-07:00","id":1125562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125550#post1125550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The problem with this is Ronin CAN be accepted back into the Garou Nation. They don't stay Ronin forever if they can make atonement for their crimes or get a tribe to take them back. Also, you missed the part about Albretch not being a Ronin but a good model for one getting accepted back into Garou society, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't miss it, I just think that -starting- with ronin is not the best choice.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125550#post1125550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. Male Black Furies already exist, they're just all Metis.<br /> <br /> 2. Yeah, the matriarchy is a shame as that's real jackals.<br /> <br /> 3. I can't complain as I actually used that plot in my homegames with a Pure vs. Forsaken Civil War.<br /> <br /> 4. Werewolf got there first, admittedly, with the Seventh Generation.<br /> <br /> But I get your point.<br /> <br /> <b>Why do I think a Ronin is a good character type?</b><br /> <br /> I think it's a really good opportunity to show the importance of Garou society as well as its failures from an outsiders perspective. If you begin the game as a Ronin, you're sort of like the character in <i>The Elder Scrolls</i>. You have no resources, no caern, no fetishes, talents, gifts or anything else. It's a great excuse for playing an adult character versus a Lost Cub who will typically be teenagers. You have nothing and the spirits don't even like you either.<br /> <br /> So, as a Ronin, you'll have to start at the bottom and earn everyone's respect in the local sept and its factions. A lot of RPGs start with you as someone who is considered scum or an outsider which the Ronin is. By doing this, you can save the lives of other werewolves and gradually improve their opinion of you. It provides a natural &quot;end point&quot; in the game too which I think people are ignoring.<br /> <br /> Once you save the area from The Black Lodge, Pentex, The Eater of Souls (hopefully they won't go there), or The Black Spiral Dancer caern or all of the above then you can be welcomed into the Garou Nation once more.<br /> <br /> That's a pretty sweet happy ending and one entirely appropriate for W:TA.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Non-metis this time, treated as a force of progression because they are even more socially aware because they suddenly had male births. Yes, really.<br /> <br /> 2. Actually, to the opposite way. The shifter that is based on an animal that is insanely matriarchal and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PBCNWmU5apE\" target=\"_blank\">brutal to their males</a>, and has been in setting split by gender due to that reason as males more placid and females more aggressive, suddenly had issues with human borns vs animal borns arguing over who should lead. And so in the book, they are now equal, no more gender based auspice split, women and men lead together now. And this is true to -every- female only faction listed, even the Fenrir Valkyrias.<br /> <br /> Hence, why I am not liking it. It isn't equality, it is involving male characters in female only or female led spaces.<br /> <br /> 3. I wouldn't mind, but the split is so poorly done.<br /> <br /> 4. Seventh Generation were always villains and never PCs meant to be played.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T06:45:56-07:00","id":1125579,"title":"","content":"Yes, who would really want to play a bunch of Wyrn-worshipping, misogynistic, rapine, pedophile fomori? And I think that going after the Seventh Generation would have made a better WtA game than just going after Pentex.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T07:05:39-07:00","id":1125584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125579#post1125579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, who would really want to play a bunch of Wyrn-worshipping, misogynistic, rapine, pedophile fomori? And I think that going after the Seventh Generation would have made a better WtA game than just going after Pentex.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think they meant that. I think it was more in terms of the content, because Seventh Generation IS pretty bad and disturbing. For me, it is only a more organized version of IRL human trade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T08:09:45-07:00","id":1125599,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1125579#post1125579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">misogynistic, rapine, pedophile fomori? And I think that going after the Seventh Generation would have made a better WtA game than just going after Pentex.</div> </div> </div> </div>I strongly believe that the game will not contain such sensitive elements, just good traditional gore violence. <br /> <br /> Plus the best way to enjoy the primal gore violent element of the game would be a 3rd person action rpg rather than anything else.","signa