-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it really a WtA game if you are playing a Ronin? I mean, Tribe is so central to the Garou experience that I do not really think that you can actually be Garou unless you have a Tribe (the Spirits of the Pact sure as heck do not think so). I would much rather have the character just choose a Tribe and run with that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Every Garou without the tribe is a Ronin so technically every cub is a Ronin until found by a sept. Unless being born within one. So it is pretty acceptable for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T08:22:37-07:00","id":1133384,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118330#post1118330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I dunno, maybe because when making a sexy intriguing creature of the night you don't want to be a fourteen-year-old adolescent?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Why not? Imagine being sent to the principal for breaking and entering to Pentex facility? Or being grounded by your parents during the moot <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T08:23:41-07:00","id":1133385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133369#post1133369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Every Garou without the tribe is a Ronin so technically every cub is a Ronin until found by a sept. Unless being born within one. So it is pretty acceptable for me.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, Ronin are specifically cast out. Lost Cubs and Lunatics are still ascribed some degree of hopeful potential that Ronin are not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T08:29:28-07:00","id":1133388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118367#post1118367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's how I imagine the story will go:<br /> <br /> * You start the game as a Ronin Garou who has either amnesia or has their backstory explained to them early on. &quot;You were a Garou who were part of a sept but have been cast out in recent years due to some crime you were accused of.&quot; I predict it will be perhaps something like Lee in The Walking Dead where your crime is something understanable like killing a superior ranked Garou outside of a challenge.<br /> <br /> * At the Sept in the region, you'll have a Silver Fang King who is complete scum and an arrogant asshole because they're easy Heels to throw at players. The Silver Fang King will be secretly corrupted by the Wyrm.<br /> <br /> * The other factions at the Sept will include the Shadow Lords who will be the EVIL Garou who want to overthrow the Silver Fang King as well as those who want to reform the King. Maybe also a third Gaian Garou faction of Bone Gnawers and Glass Walkers.<br /> <br /> * The area of the Garou is being intruded on by Pentex and their Black Spiral Dancer allies who the PC is about the only person who can do anything against because the actual Sept and its rulership is a mess right now.<br /> <br /> * You can ally with one of the factions to do their dirty work or do the dirty work of multiple ones before finally choosing. This will eventually make you choose who will be the new King after you finally challenge the Silver Fang King with one of the fangs backing you up. You will possibly be able to be the King yourself.<br /> <br /> * I see possible locations as a BSD Hive underground, a rural town, a Pentex Factory, the Spirit World, and the Sept itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've got more crazy vision: the main character is really Ryan McCullough from previous W:tA video game (it has never been released but cutscenes give you the ending: Ryan became a hero but is still a Ronin <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T09:09:02-07:00","id":1133405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1118492#post1118492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How can you have a former BSD? Once you walk the spiral, there is no coming back, you are forever bound to the Wyrm.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had a BSD, former pupil of my PCs, and they tried to find a way to redeem him. They had those ideas:<br /> 1. Going to Erebus<br /> 2. Going to Summer Country<br /> 3. Going to Pangea and give him time<br /> 4. Find a gurahl and ask him to cleanse their former student<br /> 5. Give him time.<br /> Finally they decided to kill him anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T09:26:34-07:00","id":1133414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133385#post1133385\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, Ronin are specifically cast out. Lost Cubs and Lunatics are still ascribed some degree of hopeful potential that Ronin are not.</div> </div> </div> </div>OK, but they are tribeless until being accepted by one. So they are Ronin TECHNICALLY, without negative social consequences.<br /> <br /> I know that I've read that somewhere: &quot;until properly accepted into a tribe, a Garou is considered Ronin, and she gains no special abilities of any tribe, even from the spirits&quot; Werewolf Player's Guide Revised Edition p. 79","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 02-17-2019, 11:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T09:28:25-07:00","id":1133416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133388#post1133388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I've got more crazy vision: the main character is really Ryan McCullough from previous W:tA video game (it has never been released but cutscenes give you the ending: Ryan became a hero but is still a Ronin <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" al