an style=\"font-size:13px\"> but one </span></span></span>and 2 more children of Gaia in frenzy. Then became Ronin, then he turned Black Spiral Dancer and way later on, one of the latest player characters who achieved elder Rank captured him, cleansed him with a cleanse or die Helios Gift and he became Ronin again.<br /> He ended up as an immortal ancestor like entity guarding the streampaths to the Memory of Gaia, linking all Tribes (even lost ones) with their ancestors, yes Silent Striders can gain the ancestor background if they associate with this guy.<br /> <br /> I have even given a thought to use him as a plot device in order to bring back the lost Tribes, you can easily introduce Ryan to this Guy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> A former Black Spiral Dancer who became Ronin meets a Ronin who walked the Black Spiral intact and gives him the White Howler ancestor Background.<br /> Can't be more epic !!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","user":"Story Letter","date":". 08-24-2017, 12:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T11:39:47-07:00","id":1133476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_post