bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133424#post1133424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I give you another one.<br /> <br /> Greek Fenrir with black wolf fur, killed all his packmates <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> but one </span></span></span>and 2 more children of Gaia in frenzy. Then became Ronin, then he turned Black Spiral Dancer and way later on, one of the latest player characters who achieved elder Rank captured him, cleansed him with a cleanse or die Helios Gift and he became Ronin again.<br /> He ended up as an immortal ancestor like entity guarding the streampaths to the Memory of Gaia, linking all Tribes (even lost ones) with their ancestors, yes Silent Striders can gain the ancestor background if they associate with this guy.<br /> <br /> I have even given a thought to use him as a plot device in order to bring back the lost Tribes, you can easily introduce Ryan to this Guy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> A former Black Spiral Dancer who became Ronin meets a Ronin who walked the Black Spiral intact and gives him the White Howler ancestor Background.<br /> Can't be more epic !!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, right. Put there also Charon to help them find Cororuc and master Voormas to rule them all, Morningstar to find them, and Cain to bring them all and in darkness bind them :P.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 08-24-2017, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T13:12:49-07:00","id":1133524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133478#post1133478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, rights. Put there also Charon to help them find Cororuc and master Voormas to rule them all, Morningstar to find them, and Cain to bring them all and in darkness bind them :P.</div> </div> </div> </div>That means I have created a signature plot uber character ? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> That reminds me a poem one of my players made for our party pack:<br /> ''one pack to track them down, one pack to find them, one pack to blind them all and in the darkness grind them''<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T15:31:09-07:00","id":1133567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133524#post1133524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That means I have created a signature plot uber character ? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> That reminds me a poem one of my players made for our party pack:<br /> ''one pack to track them down, one pack to find them, one pack to blind them all and in the darkness grind them''</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No, that means this is pure surrealism. But at least you have players who are able to kill each other characters. I met a player like that. His Shadow Lord earned 4th rank. He killed 2 Ahrouns, one Fenrir and one Silver Fang on the way, not raising a single claw.<br /> <br /> Poem is nice. It reminds me a heavy metal band formed by me and my player's characters. I still have about 80 songs, lyrics written but without music.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 08-24-2017, 11:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-25T06:27:28-07:00","id":1133763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133567#post1133567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> No, that means this is pure surrealism. But at least you have players who are able to kill each other characters. I met a player like that. His Shadow Lord earned 4th rank. He killed 2 Ahrouns, one Fenrir and one Silver Fang on the way, not raising a single claw.<br /> <br /> Poem is nice. It reminds me a heavy metal band formed by me and my player's characters. I still have about 80 songs, lyrics written but without music.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe your Shadow Lord did it on purpose but our Fenrir did it because he lost control and he was rank 1, plus he killed more than his pack.<br /> And yes we also had lots of black metal poems, my player who played our Fenrir Ahroun Lupus was black metal singer in real life.<br /> <br /> ''In topic''<br /> I wish that the hero you will be able to play will not be a signature character, but one that uses character creation process. I would really like that we would be able to choose sex, breed (metis plz) and auspice, and of course further customization like hair, face, beard, tattoo etc etc. I wish for the character to have advantages and disadvantages depending on Breed and Auspice, Breed alone would still be nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-25T08:30:52-07:00","id":1133797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133763#post1133763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe your Shadow Lord did it on purpose but our Fenrir did it because he lost control and he was rank 1, plus he killed more than his pack.<br /> And yes we also had lots of black metal poems, my player who played our Fenrir Ahroun Lupus was black metal singer in real life.<br /> <br /> ''In topic''<br /> I wish that the hero you will be able to play will not be a signature character, but one that uses character creation process. I would really like that we would be able to choose sex, breed (metis plz) and auspice, and of course further customization like hair, face, beard, tattoo etc etc. I wish for the character to have advantages and disadvantages depending on Breed and Auspice, Breed alone would still be nice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup, for me it was a perfect example of Shadow Lord attitude. And personally I don't like black metal. I am a fan of classic hard rock (Deep Purple 4 life) I wrote lyrics having hard rock in mind.<br /> <br /> In topic<br /> I would also like to see a random character generator included. You cannot choose your look, DOB or family. I try to convince my players for creating characters that way. It can be interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 08-25-2017, 12:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-25T10:52:15-07:00","id":1133857,"title":"","content":"I would pleasantly play this game time and again, with differet characters, building various skill trees to see as many options as possible inside the story, and of course run in lupus form for countless hours <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> If cyanide allows it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-25T11:08:49-07:00","id":1133865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133857#post1133857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would pleasantly play this game time and again, with differet characters, building various skill trees to see as many options as possible inside the story, and of course run in lupus form for countless hours <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> If cyanide allows it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Only time will tell. But I'm dying to see it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-26T23:48:26-07:00","id":1134374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1133405#post1133405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I had a BSD, former pupil of my PCs, and they tried to find a way to redeem him. They had those ideas:<br /> 1. Going to Erebus<br /> 2. Going to Summer Country<br /> 3. Going to Pangea and give him time<br /> 4. Find a gurahl and ask him to cleanse their former student<br /> 5. Give him time.<br /> Finally they decided to kill him anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>!<br /> Why didn't they at least give the Black Spiral Dancer time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T06:45:32-07:00","id":1134448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1134374#post1134374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">!<br /> Why didn't they at least give the Black Spiral Dancer time?</div> </div> </div> </div>They weren't sure if it's gonna work. And Alpha of the pack (with tears in player's eyes) decided that it would be too risky for her pack. They would have to hide him and if someone from the sept would find out about it they would be surely torn apart for siding with Wyrm. Besides this particular BSD was a living proof of their own stupidity. They found him shortly after becoming Fosterns (well, at least some of them) in a gym on a bad side of town. Charlie (cause that was his human name) was Rocky'esque character, poor kid from a poor family living in a bad side of town trying to become a professional boxer to help his family. He also knew all the gangs from the neighbourhood (he wasn't involved in the underground, just a few friends from school and a local capo) and those infos the PCs wanted. During the conversation which was slowly becoming an interrogation Charlie undergone his First Change nearly killing Silver Fang Ahroun and Gaillard Fenrir (mostly by blind luck than his skills) in a rage before they were able to stop him. And they had to choose: either turn him to a sept where he could learn from entire sept or hide him and train him all by themselves (he was Gaillard) and present him in a sept later as a fully trained garou ready for his Rite of Passage. They chose later option (they were Fosterns they were fully capable for teaching right?). Unfortunately in the sept a BSD spy was hiding (I was running one of the adventures from Storyteller's Screen). He planned to take Moonstone and some fetishes from the caern and decided to take the cub as a bonus (he found out about it). He told Charlie that he would prove that caern isn't properly defended and other garou would try to kill him for that rather than accept their flaws. He convinced him to meet him at the construction site and when PCs found them there they tried to kill BSD for endangering the caern. Charlie then defended him and the PCs made a terrible mistake: rather than shove the cub aside and bring justice to BSD as they should they left them there and went to the caern to convince the sept to strenghten their defence lines (BSD told them that he would return stolen items when they prove that caern is safe). At the same time BSD took Charlie and made him a BSD. But Charlie didn't like it (actually he was cheated; BSD posing as a Ronin, former Uktena, told Charlie about a sept &quot; that is properly managed and accept everyone who thinks before acting&quot;) and the ritual didn't destroyed his mind. He knew that every other garou will kill him rather than help him so he &quot;arranged the meeting&quot; with his former teachers (he allowed them find himself). Firstly they tried to give him a honourable death and challenged him. As the challenged one he chose the rules and chose a chess game, trying to buy himself some time. The PC lost (one of the players had to play chess with me) and during the game he tried to convince them that he is willing to return to the sept if only they would help him. Alpha didn't want to choose if Charlie should live or be killed so she ordered rest of her pack to act as a jury. And, what a surprise, a draw. So she still had to decide. And she chose death. The best thing is that her garou lover (yes, she weren't following the Litany too), one of the NPCs, knew one gurahl who could help. He didn't told anybody about it for fear of intolerance of other garou. And when he told Alpha about this gurahl it was too late. That was one of my best games. Player who played Alpha cried during the game for the first time in her life (I mean during the game). Twice <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 08-29-2017, 07:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-11T13:04:32-07:00","id":1139527,"title":"","content":"Oh, I hope in this game that the character will not spawn weapons from the bag of holding, like in shooting games <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> But rather have limited number of pockets- backpack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-13T11:15:39-07:00","id":1139975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1139527#post1139527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, I hope in this game that the character will not spawn weapons from the bag of holding, like in shooting games <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> But rather have limited number of pockets- backpack.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why not? In one official adventure, &quot;Night of Rage&quot;; published in WW magazine, was a fetish called Coyote's Bag (if I remember correctly). It allowed the user to find almost anything inside. From very useful things (like low power talens), to not-so-obviously useful (like a key to the doors which the character will find in the future) to deadly (like a dynamite with 3 sec to explosion) to potentially deadly (like local Ahroun underwear).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-13T12:01:55-07:00","id":1139983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1139975#post1139975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why not?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well thats one occasion of a fetish that is not common at all. Not realy a fan of <b>bag of holding</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Unfortunately we will do se rapid and clean (I hope not) dressing up of character after crinos rampage. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-13T12:51:33-07:00","id":1139990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1139983#post1139983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blu