tps://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />, I will go with Sims option hehe.<br /> <br /> By the way what tribes you believe will be better for this game ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T11:30:39-07:00","id":1140252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1140230#post1140230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Please no <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />, I will go with Sims option hehe.<br /> <br /> By the way what tribes you believe will be better for this game ?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know. I don't see tribes better or worse. Especially since I found out that even if, during Prelude, you create character using rules for mortals using backgrounds for garou you still won't fit to every tribe. The most universal combination is female lupus with Fetish, Totem and Kinfolk and Willpower at least 5. You can't be a Silver Fang but the rest of the tribes will accept you (if you follow the rules to the letter of course). And remember that multitribal septs are rarity, so if you start as tribeless garou (or cub) your choice can be limited. It depends of course of the ST but in my games players rarely get the tribe they wanted. But they are happy, they like challenges. My personal favorites are Fianna, Children of Gaia, Wendigo and Fenrir but my favourite character was Theurge Glass Walker, leader of a hard rock/heavy metal band.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T12:16:43-07:00","id":1140271,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1140252#post1140252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't know. I don't see tribes better or worse. Especially since I found out that even if, during Prelude, you create character using rules for mortals using backgrounds for garou you still won't fit to every tribe. The most universal combination is female lupus with Fetish, Totem and Kinfolk and Willpower at least 5. You can't be a Silver Fang but the rest of the tribes will accept you (if you follow the rules to the letter of course). And remember that multitribal septs are rarity, so if you start as tribeless garou (or cub) your choice can be limited. It depends of course of the ST but in my games players rarely get the tribe they wanted. But they are happy, they like challenges. My personal favorites are Fianna, Children of Gaia, Wendigo and Fenrir but my favourite character was Theurge Glass Walker, leader of a hard rock/heavy metal band.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I actually believe that there will be no backgrounds and you will not begin the game with a fetish, but most likely the game will include quite a few. Also I don't believe there will be a willpower trait, more like balance between Rage and Gnosis. <br /> Appart from that I suspect the game will have tribes that will be more likely to accept a redeemed ronin, with red talons and black furies excluded if you will play a fix premade character and included if you may have breed and sex options in the character creation. Yes there will be indian garou and Silver Fangs since it will be a north America campaign, most likely Fenrir and maybe Glass walkers, since it has been mentioned that there will be computer hacking options. I have read that there will be single tribal septs and the choice to join one in order to gain tribal gifts.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T12:39:01-07:00","id":1140282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1140271#post1140271\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I actually believe that there will be no backgrounds and you will not begin the game with a fetish, but most likely the game will include quite a few. Also I don't believe there will be a willpower trait, more like balance between Rage and Gnosis.<br /> Appart from that I suspect the game will have tribes that will be more likely to accept a redeemed ronin, with red talons and black furies excluded if you will play a fix premade character and included if you may have breed and sex options in the character creation. Yes there will be indian garou and Silver Fangs since it will be a north America campaign, most likely Fenrir and maybe Glass walkers, since it has been mentioned that there will be computer hacking options. I have read that there will be single tribal septs and the choice to join one in order to gain tribal gifts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe. But IMHO redeemed ronin is not a good idea. Ronin could achieve even Elder rank and beeing thrown out from the sept doesn't strip Ronin from his rank. And cliath ronin? Pleeeeaaasssse, that means that being almost a cub he did something so evil that the rest don't want to see them again. I would rather play a cub (maybe lost one when you want to play older character) who have to find his way around. As for backgrounds they really can be useful, even if they will be treated lightly. I forgot to mention that I like also Shadow Lords but I didn't find any player(ok, maybe 2 or 3) that remember that SL speciality is testing others patience and sending someone else to do dirty work for them. And to send one Garou/sept against other one. Most players don't want to accept it or to cause damage to other player's characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 09-14-2017, 04:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T18:08:22-07:00","id":1140375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1140282#post1140282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Maybe. But IMHO redeemed ronin is not a good idea. Ronin could achieve even Elder rank and beeing thrown out from the sept doesn't strip Ronin from his rank.</div> </div> </div> </div>But Ronin have no Rank. It's how being Ronin works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":