y.<br /> 10. And kill a bunch of Fenrir or Fangs maybe. Man I love Garou conflict.<br /> 11.And hang out with fairies <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> 12.Striders might accept a ronin if he aided them in a rescue mission and yup if he is fast and stealthy.[/SIZE][/FONT][/COLOR]</div> </div> </div> </div>OK, I presented here simplified version. I tried to put these tribes in order from the easiest way to bring the Ronin back to Garou Nation to the hardest. And I'm still not convinced that making Ronin the main character is a good choice. I would rather see the campaign the way they did in most D&amp;D based video games, with auspices and tribes working as character classes. And to be a leader of the pack of course <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> As for conflicts between tribes I am sure that you would appreciate the way that my friend's Shadow Lord resolve that problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T13:27:59-07:00","id":1140620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1140613#post1140613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would rather see the campaign the way they did in most D&amp;D based video games, with auspices and tribes working as character classes. And to be a leader of the pack of course <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br /> <br /> Me too my friend, me too &quot;sigh&quot;. But if with a ronin we can get a good story, fine by me.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1140613#post1140613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for conflicts between tribes I am sure that you would appreciate the way that my friend's Shadow Lord resolve that problem.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have already appreciated our Silver Fang. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T13:40:25-07:00","id":1140624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1140620#post1140620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Me too my friend, me too &quot;sigh&quot;. But if with a ronin we can get a good story, fine by me.[/SIZE][/FONT][/COLOR]<br /> <br /> <br /> [COLOR=#252C2F][FONT=Helvetica][SIZE=13px]<br /> <br /> I have already appreciated our Silver Fang. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It will propably be a sad story about his/her parents (especially mother) :P. And what did SF do?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 09-15-2017, 04:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T14:12:44-07:00","id":1140636,"title":"","content":"Well let's say that he did not allow them to last, for rank 4 he had to make 2 septs to make peace with each other (furies/fenrir), short version of it was that it took personal sacrifice and brave acting in order to do so, but he also was in good terms with both septs while he was in lower rank. He discovered lupus kinfolk and brought them close to Fury territory and aided them to woman their caern after losing septmates to wyrm assault, convincing the leaders to accept women from other tribes, Shadow Lords included.<br /> For the fenrir he found out how one of their kin died and took revenge from his slayers, he also restored relationship with a Gnawer sept that has been accused by the fenrir that hid the reason of their tribemate's death. Our Silver Fang Philodox defeated one of the Fenrir Ahrouns in klaive dueling without killing him, gaining great honor among them (epic duel). They even gave him one of their Galliards to become his packmate. After his Athro rank raising he became obssessed with Garou nation unity, if there was an enmity between two Garou he would do anything to make them work together, one of such conflicts almost killed one of his packmates and he was close to lose rank and support from Falcon. But he triumphed anyway and became a good tyrant that cares for the prosperity of his own kind. He also made a Shadow Lord admire him and have him as example for all Garou leaders.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> THE END","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","user":"Story Letter","date":". 09-15-2017, 05:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T14:53:53-07:00","id":1140653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Story Letter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1117007-cyanide-s-werewolf-the-apocalypse-video-game?p=1140636#post1140636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well let's say that he did not allow them to last, for rank 4 he had to make 2 septs to make peace with each other (furies/fenrir), short version of it was that it took personal sacrifice and brave acting in order to do so, but he also was in good terms with both septs while he was in lower rank. He discovered lupus kinfolk and brought them close to Fury territory and aided them to woman their caern after losing septmates to wyrm assault, convincing the leaders to accept women from other tribes, Shadow Lords included.<br /> For the fenrir he found out how one of their kin died and took revenge from his slayers, he also restored relationship with a Gnawer sept that has been accused by the fenrir that hid the reason of their tribemate's death. Our Silver Fang Philodox defeated one of the Fenrir Ahrouns in klaive dueling without killing him, gaining great honor among them (epic duel). They even gave him one of their Galliards to become his packmate. After his Athro rank raising he became obssessed with Garou nation unity, if there was an enmity between two Garou he would do anything to make them work together, one of such conflicts almost killed one of his packmates and he was close to lose rank and support from Falcon. But he triumphed anyway and became a good tyrant that cares for the prosperity of his own kind. He also made a Shadow Lord admire him and have him as example for all Garou leaders.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> THE END</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe we shouldn't exchange our favourite stories here (but I shouldn't mind if Cyanide use them as inspiration :P). So long story short: my friend's SL tried to win the sept for the tribe. He send one of his main rivals to certain death and &quot;convince&quot; the other one to kill himself. And he did it without gifts, fetishes, rites or help from the spirit. If you want more details send me a message <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T01:33:49-07:00","id":1140738,"title":"","content":"Hey all! Do you think these are good news?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gamingbolt.com/werewolf-the-apocalypse-interview-what-we-want-is-a-strong-story\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_c